(text "NOTES (V1-draft4, 2026-10-24)\nJ1: right-angle keyed IDC box header 2x8 P2.54 on the B side, opening past the top edge (body overhangs ~9.4 mm);\n    pins soldered on the F side (skin side): trim flush + kapton. Cable: 16-wire IDC-IDC, both sockets keyed,\n    red stripe = pin 1, base J2 pin n = wrist J1 pin n; check continuity before first power-up. Pinout (2026-10-24): 3V3/GND at 1-2, GND between signals, MOSI-MISO at 15-16.\nAssembly: solder both module headers to this board first, trim tails flush, kapton under modules,\n    then mount M1 and M3 on the headers; nylon M3 standoffs at the 3 holes (4th corner: adhesive spacer).\nM1 SparkFun MAX30101: cut JP1 (power LED) - red LED is on the sensor face. Check Qwiic connectors vs skin contact.\nM3 SparkFun BMI270 1x1: cut I2C and ADR jumpers for SPI mode (see custom_board_proposal A.3).\nC2/C3 at the cable entry (J1.1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 100.00 30.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d9b3c46f-181a-4af8-ad12-f985c6a5005c"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
